ES:
{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Fiuuuu! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Buuuum!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} ¡Oooooh!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
